:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Nyalladin (Enemy)]].''
'''Doll Cats''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from clearing any stage in [[Bears be Bare (Monthly Event)|Bears be Bare]]. It was added in [[Version 2.1 Update#Version 2.1.3 Update|Version 2.1.3]]. [[True Form]] grants a Lv.1 [[Wave Attack]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Doll Cats are unlockable via the [[Rare Cat Capsule]] pool after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] from Chapter One.

