==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cat-o-tron''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Nyalladin''' when obtained from [[Doll Cats Awake!]] (may be dropped on the first stage but is guaranteed on the second stage) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Treat this unit as another [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]], but just like the latter, this unit is basically useless outside [[Empire of Cats Levels (EN)|Empire of Cats]] and its numerous [[Cat Combo]]s due to low stats and high cost.

==='''True Form'''===
Nyalladin can be used for some very specific situations in which a wave unit would be needed, for example, by stacking many against a base. Due to the difficulty of the stage that unlocks its True Form, however, it is usually not viable by that point, as its high cost, short range, low wave coverage, horrid health and long foreswing make it near-impossible for them to do anything meaningful.

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave}}

