==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], Doll Cats' descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Doll Cats
Cats that have dressed up as dolls.
Don't have much health but shoots laser
beams to take down many foes (Area Attack)</pre>
<pre>Cat-o-tron
This young Cat controls the Cat Robot,
Cat-o-tron, to fire laser beams (Area Attack)
Unfortunately, it's not wireless yet.</pre>
<pre>Nyalladin
Always owns the latest model carpet,
can call on his turbaned friend to fire
powerful wave attacks. (Area Attack)</pre>
**Nyalladin's original description stated that he could "call on his turbaned friend to fire powerful wave attacks", but it is the genie who attacks.
*The timing of the event is a celebration of the Japanese festival [[wikipedia:Hinamatsuri|Hinamatsuri]], which falls on the third of March.
*The Japanese name of the Evolved Form 超号珍ニャジンガー (''Chō-gō Chin Nyajingā'', '''Super Rare Nyazinger''') is a reference to Mazinger (pronounced "Majinga") Z, an iconic super robot anime where said robot is said to be made of Chogokin (Super Alloy) Z, The headpiece even resembles the robot's cockpit.
*The appearance of its Evolved Form, however, is based on Iron Man No.28 (Tetsujin 28-gou, also known as Gigantor), the first anime featuring a giant robot. The cat with the remote controller references Shotaro Kaneda, the kid who commanded the robot by the exact same means.
*Its True Form resembles a [[Media:Scaredy cat masquerade 4.jpg|runner-up design]] from the [[PONOS Campaigns/Scaredy Cat Masquerade!|Scaredy Cat Masquerade!]] fan art contest celebrated in October 2015.
*The True Form is a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Aladdin (1992 Disney film)|Aladdin]]''.

